{"resourceType":"ValueSet","id":"vsac-2.16.840.1.113762.1.4.1110.62-20210409","meta":{"versionId":"10","lastUpdated":"2026-01-06T09:57:08.000-05:00","profile":["http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/shareablevalueset","http://hl7.org/fhir/us/cqfmeasures/StructureDefinition/computable-valueset-cqfm","http://hl7.org/fhir/us/cqfmeasures/StructureDefinition/publishable-valueset-cqfm"]},"language":"en","extension":[{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/valueset-author","valueContactDetail":{"name":"Joint Commission"}},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/valueset-keyWord","valueString":"STK-02,STK-05"},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/resource-lastReviewDate","valueDate":"2026-01-06"},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/valueset-effectiveDate","valueDateTime":"2021-04-09"},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/artifact-effectivePeriod","valuePeriod":{"start":"2021-04-09"}}],"url":"http://cts.nlm.nih.gov/fhir/ValueSet/2.16.840.1.113762.1.4.1110.62","identifier":[{"system":"urn:ietf:rfc:3986","value":"urn:oid:2.16.840.1.113762.1.4.1110.62"}],"version":"20210409","name":"AntithromboticTherapyForIschemicStroke","title":"Antithrombotic Therapy for Ischemic Stroke","status":"active","experimental":false,"date":"2026-01-06T09:57:08-05:00","publisher":"Joint Commission","jurisdiction":[{"extension":[{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/data-absent-reason","valueCode":"unknown"}]}],"purpose":"(Clinical Focus: The purpose of this value set is to represent concepts of medications that are anticoagulant and antiplatelet medications used to reduce stroke mortality and morbidity.),(Data Element Scope: This value set may use a model element related to Medication.),(Inclusion Criteria: Includes concepts that represent a medication that is an antithrombotic medication, including oral, rectal, and injectable dose forms.),(Exclusion Criteria: Excludes concepts that represent enoxaparin and heparin generally given for VT